        <mxCell id="flow-box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Amazon Ember;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="843" width="1495" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flow-title" value="&lt;b&gt;Traffic flow&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Amazon Ember;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="519" y="848" width="380" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flow-text" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;LOGIN &amp;amp; CREDENTIAL BOOTSTRAP&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; User signs in to Streamlit (password grant, or X.509 mTLS auto-login)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Keycloak password grant &amp;rarr; full-session OAuth token&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; RFC 8693 token exchange &amp;rarr; downscoped token (aud = mcp-server) for the agents&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; EJBCA pkcs10enroll &amp;rarr; user certificate (keypair generated locally, 7-day validity)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;5.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; EJBCA pkcs10enroll &amp;rarr; three agent certificates: {user}_orchestrator-agent, {user}_mysql-agent, {user}_email-agent&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot;&gt;6.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(in-process)&lt;/i&gt; Streamlit mints the user-signed delegation over the three agent-cert fingerprints &amp;mdash; the only use of the user private key&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#3F8624&quot;&gt;7.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Store user + agent P12 bundles and the session token in Secrets Manager&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;DATABASE QUERY &amp;mdash; TRIPLE AUTH&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;8.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; User asks a question in natural language&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ED7100&quot;&gt;9.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Streamlit hands the orchestrator the downscoped token + delegation (user key stays UI-side)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#01A88D&quot;&gt;10.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Orchestrator signs a request envelope with its own key (RSA-PSS PoP) &amp;rarr; MySQL Agent&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;11.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; MySQL Agent verifies it: PoP signature, freshness, nonce anti-replay, CA chain, role = orchestrator-agent, OCSP&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot;&gt;12.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(in-process)&lt;/i&gt; MySQL Agent loads its own P12 and signs a per-call envelope bound to the exact {tool, args}&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;13.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Spawns FastMCP Server over stdio; each call carries auth = {token, delegation, envelope} &amp;mdash; no keys, no credentials in the environment&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;14.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; MCP 1/3 &amp;mdash; Keycloak introspection: token active and aud contains mcp-server&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;15.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; MCP 2/3 &amp;mdash; verify the mysql-agent envelope: PoP, freshness, replay, CA chain, role = mysql-agent, OCSP; payload must equal this exact call&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;16.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; MCP 3/3 &amp;mdash; verify the user delegation: signature, expiry, calling-agent fingerprint, OCSP on the user cert&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot;&gt;17.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(in-process)&lt;/i&gt; Identity cross-check: token username == delegation.sub == agent CN prefix&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C925D1&quot;&gt;18.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Execute SQL on RDS MySQL (users table only; DROP / TRUNCATE / ALTER / CREATE / GRANT / REVOKE blocked)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;EMAIL &amp;mdash; AGENT TO AGENT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#01A88D&quot;&gt;19.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Orchestrator signs a request envelope &amp;rarr; Email Agent&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;20.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Email Agent verifies it (PoP + CA chain + role = orchestrator-agent + OCSP)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;21.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Email Agent sends the message through Amazon SES&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;MODEL INFERENCE&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#01A88D&quot;&gt;22.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; All three agents run on Amazon Bedrock (Strands SDK)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Amazon Ember;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="441" y="871" width="670" height="362" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flow-sep" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;strokeWidth=1;" parent="1" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="35" y="653" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="385" y="653" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-text" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;ALWAYS TRUE&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Private keys never cross a trust boundary &amp;mdash; only public certs and signatures travel. Each component loads its own P12 from Secrets Manager and signs in-process.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Every OCSP and introspection check &lt;b&gt;fails closed&lt;/b&gt;: an unreachable responder denies the request.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Forward-only trust graph: MySQL and Email Agent accept only orchestrator-agent; the MCP server accepts only mysql-agent. No lateral agent calls.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Lifetimes: certificates 7 days, delegation 12 hours, request envelopes 60 seconds.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; The downscoped token is short-lived; the MySQL Agent re-mints it on demand from stored session state (it never sees the full-session token).&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Logout revokes the user cert and all agent certs in EJBCA and deletes the secrets, invalidating every outstanding delegation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#232F3E&quot;&gt;LEGEND&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Solid arrow = request / data path&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Dashed arrow = credential validation (OCSP, introspection) or model call&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Numbers on arrows map to the steps above; greyed steps are in-process and have no network hop.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Amazon Ember;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1175" y="851" width="658" height="272" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v5eNqX5SJI5hlTBJsDKn-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#C925D1;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontFamily=Amazon Ember;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.083;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;exitX=0.529;exitY=0.829;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="mcp-server" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="1430" y="280" />
              <mxPoint x="1430" y="440" />
            </Array>
            <mxPoint x="1409" y="300" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1429" y="659.98" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v5eNqX5SJI5hlTBJsDKn-2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;background-color:#FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C925D1&quot;&gt;18&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=12;fontFamily=Amazon Ember;" parent="v5eNqX5SJI5hlTBJsDKn-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.5" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-14" as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
